"modules.discovery.card.commandCentre": "Command Centre",
"modules.discovery.card.commandCentre.desc": "Ctrl+K: search and run any setting, hotkey or window. Star favourites for a quick bar in game.",
"modules.discovery.card.hudHelpers": "HUD helpers",
"modules.discovery.card.hudHelpers.desc": "Movement arrow, merge countdown, relative enemy mass, edge arrows to teammates and threats, a cell mass panel.",
"modules.discovery.card.replayStudio": "Replay Studio",
"modules.discovery.card.replayStudio.desc": "Timeline, bookmarks, speed and a replay library for the games you recorded.",
"modules.discovery.card.analytics": "Analytics",
"modules.discovery.card.analytics.desc": "Your games over time: stats, heatmaps, a coach with tips and daily objectives. Kept in this browser.",
"modules.discovery.card.deathRecap": "Death recap and kill feed",
"modules.discovery.card.deathRecap.desc": "The last 20 s before a death on the Game Over card, a small feed of your eats, alerts on big mass loss.",
"modules.discovery.card.adaptivePerf": "Adaptive performance",
"modules.discovery.card.adaptivePerf.desc": "While FPS stays low, costly effects go off for now and come back when it is fast again. Diagnostics window.",
"modules.discovery.card.gamepad": "Gamepad",
"modules.discovery.card.gamepad.desc": "Play with a controller: button map, stick sensitivity, profiles and a live test.",
"modules.discovery.card.profiles": "Settings profiles",
"modules.discovery.card.profiles.desc": "Named sets of settings, theme and hotkeys, with backups and Undo; can switch by server.",
"modules.discovery.card.notifications": "Notification centre",
"modules.discovery.card.notifications.desc": "A bell with the last messages you missed, and a sound mixer per channel.",
"modules.discovery.card.hudEditor": "HUD editor",
"modules.discovery.card.hudEditor.desc": "Move, resize, lock the HUD boxes and save layouts (also per settings profile).",
"modules.discovery.card.director": "Spectator director",
"modules.discovery.card.director.desc": "For spectating: auto camera on the action, watchlist, camera bookmarks and a broadcast HUD.",
"modules.discovery.card.companion": "Stream overlay",
"modules.discovery.card.companion.desc": "A second screen or OBS source with mass, rank, minimap and leaderboard.",
"modules.discovery.card.touchEditor": "Touch control editor",
"modules.discovery.card.touchEditor.desc": "Phones: move and resize the touch buttons and the joystick.",
"modules.discovery.card.practice": "Practice arena",
"modules.discovery.card.practice.desc": "Offline drills against bots, with personal bests and a ghost of your best run. No server involved.",
"modules.discovery.card.macroEditor": "Custom macros",
"modules.discovery.card.macroEditor.desc": "Build your own key macros from steps: split, feed, wait, move to the mouse.",
"modules.discovery.card.themeWorkshop": "Theme workshop",
"modules.discovery.card.themeWorkshop.desc": "Edit the colours of the menu, HUD and game with a live preview, and save or share themes.",
"modules.discovery.card.accessibility": "Accessibility",
"modules.discovery.card.accessibility.desc": "Larger menu and HUD text, size symbols on opponents, less motion. Colour-blind colours: the theme preset.",
"modules.discovery.card.plugins": "User Scripts",
"modules.discovery.card.plugins.desc": "Add plugins from the catalogue or your own scripts, each in a slot you can turn on and off.",
"modules.discovery.card.lab": "Lab (experimental)",
"modules.discovery.card.lab.desc": "Experiments you can try one by one; all are off until you turn them on.",
